{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぎゃあ、あしゅりんです(´∀｀●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えと。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、更新できなくて\nごめんなさいっ＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベットにねっころがりながら\n書いてたんですけど…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ちゃいました(*´∀`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータイ握りながら寝てたみたいで\nマミーに叱られちゃいましたぁ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎ寝ちゃったら、\n寝顔の写メ流すからね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていわれました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけまーす(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んと、あらためまして…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレターとかプレゼントとか\nくださったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと届いてますよ(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、コメントも読んでます!\nにやにやしながら全部よんでます//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっこでも、コメント増えてないかなー\nって　何回もみちゃってます←ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も寒いですが、\nみなさんからの暖かいことばで\n乗りきれちゃいそうですね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、寒いといえば\nみなさん風邪ひいてないですか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予防するのも大事ですけど…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はあしゅりん、\n風邪をなおしちゃう魔法が\nつかえちゃったりするんですww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、もしも風邪ひいちゃったら\nあしゅりんに任せてね∩ω∩うふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ほんとにほんとに\n気をつけてくださいね??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ!\nもうすぐ期末テスト!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぎゃあああああああああ←\nどうしよーう(´Д｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強もがんばらなきゃ´｀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれか勉強おしえてくれないかなぁww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりん頑張るからみててねっ♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、写メですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パソコンでやると簡単だよ\nっていわれたんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パソコンで写真とれるんですか??\nカメラついてたんですか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくやり方わかんないです…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁ、ここまでくると\nちょっと落ち込んじゃうなぁ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばって早く載っけます(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとごめんなさい…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからたくさん\n質問がきてたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎの記事で\nこたえちゃいますね(≧∀≦)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあ、\nレッスンいってきまーす(･∀･)!あひゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなだいすきっ ((はあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊あしゅりん＊"}],"source":"archive"}